cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PolicyProbe in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "PolicyProbe: A Flipper-Driven Physical-Security Compliance Scanner Mapped to Control Frameworks"
abstract: >-
  PolicyProbe audits physical access-control technologies (RFID/NFC, sub-GHz, IR,
  iButton/1-Wire) with a Flipper Zero front-end, classifies device types and weak
  credential implementations, and maps each finding to the ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A
  and NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5 controls it provides evidence against, producing an
  audit-ready physical-security compliance report with a posture score, gap list and
  remediation roadmap.
type: software
authors:
